        { "native": "ନମସ୍ତେ, ତୁମ ନାଁ କ'ଣ?", "roman": "nômôste, tumô naṃ kôṇô?", "en": "Hi, what's your name? (to a child or friend)", "focus": "କ'ଣ", "wrong": ["କେମିତି|kemiti"] },
